{"reviewId": "8609031_86qdZQc6U", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 9, "content": "感觉这个逻辑现在并不成立，至少目前石油价格一直压低，一方面是政治博弈，另一方面是新能源技术的进步，替代作用。 而由于新能源以及AI技术的发展离不开基础设施建设，基础设施离不开稀有金属的投入。 推升了稀有金属价格，也导致了不目前金属价格暴涨。当然中间也有情绪共振的原因。 ", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "但是，从更长的时间来看，金属资源是可以被重复利用的，所以，其稀缺程度会为技术进步所缓解。唯有化石能源是不可再生资源，所以，资源约束问题往往以化石能源的涨落为最终归宿，这就是石油与金属的根本区别。", "range": "1099-1196", "chapterName": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "8609031_86qdZQc6U", "userVid": 8609031, "topics": [], "createTime": 1769340162, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 长波衰退中的增长与通胀", "author": {"userVid": 8609031, "name": "JJessica", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM4P0n5YMfJ4I0QhVlrdE4Z7nWanP2U7yLqs1sjQTGuOibg/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241202-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 211979211, "name": "蜡妹小欣", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/78EkX665csCnhF3ic21HRJFL2EIdUPG3xnKSoDSOFq5dmrETnQFpIK5e841j3n64vF2I2JlwUEKs/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "2026.3.19。原油价格暴涨。", "reviewId": "8609031_86qdZQc6U", "commentId": "8609031_86qdZQc6U_c2869858_87IFbKebX"